.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "skillastic usage" 1  "skillastic usage " 
.SH NAME
skillastic usage \- Record or inspect skill\-use events
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskillastic usage\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record or inspect skill\-use events
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
skillastic usage\-record(1)
Record one skill\-use event (for agent hooks and scripts)
.TP
skillastic usage\-show(1)
Show aggregated usage per skill
.TP
skillastic usage\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
